pty, whitespace-only or `None` keys. Each also checks that nothing was saved or changed.\n- **Idempotency:** a replay returns the same entry object without adding a second one; reusing a key with any argument changed is rejected; and a key from a failed attempt still works.\n\nTwo things to be aware of:\n- **Keys are shared across the whole ledger.** They aren't scoped per account.\n- **Subscription status isn't checked**, because the spec didn't ask for it. A subscription that isn't `active` can still be upgraded; I can add that check if you want it.","ttft_ms":3077,"type":"result","duration_ms":75879,"uuid":"313d6677-101a-4308-99df-b7f1e16bf874","ttft_stream_ms":1834,"time_to_request_ms":513,"first_content_frame_ms":1834,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-23T22:59:00.336Z"}

